{"3771390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Carefully Stamped", "steam_appid": 3771390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<i>Welcome to the world of cozy correspondence, where you are a postcard designer!</i><br><br><strong>Carefully Stamped</strong> is a wholesome postcard-making sandbox game where you take on the charming job of a postcard designer. Craft delightful cards, decorate with adorable stickers, write sweet notes, and match the perfect stamp—all while enjoying relaxing tunes and satisfying vibes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5d1e7c4d0bb08871814478f3e70b3844.poster.avif?t=1785317629\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5d1e7c4d0bb08871814478f3e70b3844.webm?t=1785317629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5d1e7c4d0bb08871814478f3e70b3844.mp4?t=1785317629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Whether you’re creating personalized mail for quirky customers or building your own dreamy stamp collection, there’s always a reason to send a little joy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/44afa52852f3d14b1c82fdae4f846d82.poster.avif?t=1785317629\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/44afa52852f3d14b1c82fdae4f846d82.webm?t=1785317629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/44afa52852f3d14b1c82fdae4f846d82.mp4?t=1785317629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📮 Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Craft &amp; Sell:</strong> Take on customer orders and craft postcards that match their unique requests and personalities.<br></li><li><strong>Design Freely:</strong> Decorate with a wide variety of cute stickers, washi tapes, doodles, and more!<br></li><li><strong>Write Notes:</strong> Pen short, wholesome messages to make every postcard feel personal and heartfelt.<br></li><li><strong>Collect Stamps:</strong> Unlock and collect a colorful assortment of stamps—from vintage vibes to quirky icons.<br></li><li><strong>Wholesome Sandbox Mode:</strong> No timers. No pressure. Just cozy creativity and peaceful play.<br></li><li><strong>Relaxing Soundtrack:</strong> Enjoy calming background tunes while you let your creativity flow.<br></li><li><strong>Mailing Magic:</strong> Drop your finished postcards into the mailbox and watch them go on their way!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/a6d35e01f45582c5995face84093a3ba.poster.avif?t=1785317629\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/a6d35e01f45582c5995face84093a3ba.webm?t=1785317629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/a6d35e01f45582c5995face84093a3ba.mp4?t=1785317629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💌 A Game for Stationery Lovers</strong></h2>If you’ve ever fallen down a sticker organization rabbit hole or lost time browsing through cute stationery, this is the game for you. <strong>Carefully Stamped</strong> turns the art of mailing into a joyful experience.<br><br><i>So grab your favorite pen, pick out a stamp, and let the postcard magic begin!</i>", "about_the_game": "<i>Welcome to the world of cozy cor